{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33645","headline":"赠郑殷处士 · 邵谒","name":"赠郑殷处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善琴不得听，嘉玉不得名。\n知音既已死，良匠亦未生。\n退居一河湄，山中物景清。\n鱼沈池水碧，鹤去松枝轻。\n长材靡入用，大厦失巨楹。\n颜子不得禄，谁谓天道平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}